012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこうして考えると\n凄いきつい上り坂だけど、\n凄い自分の力にもなったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って良かったなぁ\nって思わせてもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に本当に感謝！感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ坂道は頂点までほど遠いけど、\n今までやって来たこと、\n１つも無駄なことはなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果がともなわなかったとしても、\n自分の力の大きな大きな糧となったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね握手会で心がジワッってきたことがあってね......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『見てる人はみてるから』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われたんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/172501